WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:06,940
I cook some porridge without using the Qiankun Sword

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:12,400
Gifted by an old friend, I have heard that self-contained space can wear food.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,550
It’s made by Fang Shilianzhi. It’s so delicious.

4
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:24,620
It would be nice if Nian Nian was here too

5
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,860
She must like it

6
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,710
Get to know each other formally

7
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:31,230
My name is Lu Jianjia

8
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:32,630
You can call me Suga

9
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,160
I know you are worried about Niannian, but don’t worry

10
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,120
The person Zhen Yushi took away

11
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,640
Never a problem

12
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,810
Your mission now is to protect me

13
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,820
Just protect me

14
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,660
I will definitely let you see her

15
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:51,780
Always okay

16
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,960
I guess you should change your name to Guo Enen.
